  "text": "Recipe: Baked Tortilla Chips\nCreator: Alpesh Parmar\nCategory: Snack\nIngredients: corn tortillas, whole wheat tortillas, water, apple cider vinegar, taco seasoning\nCooking methods: bake\nInstructions: \u2022 Preheat the oven to 350 F.\n\u2022 Slice corn tortillas or whole wheat tortillas into triangles or stripes.\n\u2022 Arrange tortilla slices in a pan lined with parchment paper. Spray some water or apple cider vinegar. Optionally sprinkle some taco seasoning.\n\u2022 Bake for 15 mins. Then flip them over and bake for another 5 to 10 minutes depending on how crunchy we like the chips.\nNotes: A recipe with WHOLE GRAINS (corn tortillas or whole wheat tortillas).",
